## Model weights

The TFLite weights in `android/app/src/main/assets/` are research artifacts
produced for the accompanying thesis. They are provided for research and
evaluation. Contact the author for other uses.

The model was trained with:
- a self-built annotated dataset of historic timber-member cracks;
- the public Bridge Crack Dataset (unlabeled images, Stage A only).

